# Commit convention

Format: `<type>(<scope>): <summary>`

Types: `feat` · `fix` · `refactor` · `test` · `docs` · `chore` · `ci`

Scopes: `apps/<name>` · `core/mvvm` · `core/ui` · `core/common` · `domain` · `data` · `i18n` · `agents`

```
feat(apps/sample): show offline banner on home
fix(core/mvvm): hide loading when count hits zero
chore(i18n): translate error_generic to vi
```

One concern per commit. No secrets in commits.
